            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[IPTVMac 0.25.69 for Apple Silicon Macs running macOS 14 or later.

- Restore Previous Data now opens inside Settings and reads saved data on this Mac.
- The results show the current profile’s playlist, favorite, and watch-history counts, including zero when a category is empty.
- Check Again recalculates the counts. When archived items are available, Restore Saved Items brings them back and records the restoration date.

This build uses Apple Development signing and is unnotarized. macOS may block first launch. The ZIP and update feed are signed for Sparkle.
]]></description>
